### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
###   ToDoDo API  —  VS Code REST Client Test File
###   Install:  humao.rest-client  extension
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════

@base = http://localhost:5000/api

# ─── Health ──────────────────────────────────────────
### Health check
GET {{base}}/health


# ─── Workspaces ──────────────────────────────────────
### List all workspaces
GET {{base}}/workspaces

###

### Get single workspace (includes todoCount)
GET {{base}}/workspaces/ws-1

###

### Create workspace
POST {{base}}/workspaces
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Design Team",
  "color": "#9B59B6",
  "icon": "🎨"
}

###

### Update workspace
PUT {{base}}/workspaces/ws-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "My Team (Updated)",
  "color": "#F39C12"
}

###

### Delete workspace (also deletes its todos)
DELETE {{base}}/workspaces/ws-3


# ─── Todos ───────────────────────────────────────────
### Get all todos
GET {{base}}/todos

###

### Filter by workspace
GET {{base}}/todos?workspaceId=ws-1

###

### Filter by status
GET {{base}}/todos?status=DOING

###

### Filter by priority
GET {{base}}/todos?priority=high

###

### Search todos
GET {{base}}/todos?search=meeting

###

### Combined filters
GET {{base}}/todos?workspaceId=ws-1&status=DOING&priority=high

###

### Stats — all workspaces
GET {{base}}/todos/stats

###

### Stats — one workspace
GET {{base}}/todos/stats?workspaceId=ws-1

###

### Get single todo
GET {{base}}/todos/todo-1

###

### Create todo
POST {{base}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Design new landing page",
  "description": "Create wireframes for the redesigned homepage",
  "workspaceId": "ws-1",
  "boardName": "Design Board",
  "status": "TODO",
  "priority": "high",
  "color": "#9B59B6",
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "endTime": "11:00",
  "tags": ["design", "web"],
  "assignee": "Sona",
  "dueDate": "2025-12-31T00:00:00.000Z"
}

###

### Full update todo
PUT {{base}}/todos/todo-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Meeting with HT Team (Rescheduled)",
  "status": "TODO",
  "priority": "high",
  "color": "#FFBB00",
  "workspaceId": "ws-1"
}

###

### Status-only update (lightweight)
PATCH {{base}}/todos/todo-1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DONE"
}

###

### Delete todo
DELETE {{base}}/todos/todo-4
